  "description_text": "Description: Give your smartwatch a bold, durable upgrade with our Rugged Armor Protective Case and Sport Band combo. Designed for ultimate protection, this case features a shock-resistant build with reinforced edges, ensuring your watch stays safe from bumps, scratches, and everyday wear. The transparent case highlights the watch’s design while adding a tough, industrial look. Paired with a high-quality silicone sport band, it offers superior comfort, flexibility, and a secure fit—perfect for workouts, outdoor adventures, or daily use. ⚡ Sleek. Strong. Built to last. Protect your smartwatch in style.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Give your smartwatch a bold, durable upgrade with our Rugged Armor Protective Case and Sport Band combo. Designed for ultimate protection, this case features a shock-resistant build with reinforced edges, ensuring your watch stays safe from bumps, scratches, and everyday wear.</p>\n<p>The transparent case highlights the watch’s design while adding a tough, industrial look. Paired with a high-quality silicone sport band, it offers superior comfort, flexibility, and a secure fit—perfect for workouts, outdoor adventures, or daily use.</p>\n<p>⚡ Sleek. Strong. Built to last. Protect your smartwatch in style.</p>"
